      "id": "claim_f71cd1e188ba448da0b1aac3394155bb",
      "statement": "useAuth caches the session user under qk.auth.me (staleTime 5 minutes, refetchOnWindowFocus/retry off), decodes JWT expiry client-side without a library (malformed payload counts as expired), and on login/logout cancels the in-flight auth query, removes every query whose key does not start with 'auth', and clears the mutation cache so a late response from a previous account cannot repopulate the next session; logout also disposes the agent socket and forgets the assistant conversation.",
