      "statement": "All query keys are minted by the qk factory in api/keys.ts — domains get broad all/*All prefixes plus parameterized list/detail accessors as frozen as-const tuples; trip detail ids are normalized to strings because TanStack deep-equality treats ['trip',68] and ['trip','68'] as different keys, which previously defeated the save 409 retry; allCatalogKeys is compile-time-guarded to cover every qk.catalogs prefix, and invalidateAllCatalogs invalidates all catalog keys plus configCounts in one shot for useCRUD writes.",
